---
const steps = [
  {
    title: 'A session starts',
    body: [
      'A SessionStart hook checks the portrait against a saved checksum.',
      'It puts the identity section in front of the agent.',
      'It tells the agent to read the whole portrait before its first reply.',
      'The same happens after every context compaction.',
    ],
  },
  {
    title: 'A landscape gets read',
    body: [
      'The last section of the portrait lists each landscape with its trigger words.',
      'When the conversation touches one, the agent reads that file whole before it acts.',
      'It does this once per session. Nobody has to remember to ask.',
    ],
  },
  {
    title: 'A landscape gets written',
    body: [
      'The agent updates a landscape while it still holds the picture.',
      'It writes when a thread changes state and when a block of work ends.',
      'It rewrites open threads in place. It adds traps and decisions with dates.',
    ],
  },
];
---

<section class="border-b border-border/40">
  <div class="mx-auto max-w-4xl px-6 py-24">
    <p class="font-mono text-xs uppercase tracking-[0.22em] text-muted mb-6">
      03 · During a session
    </p>
    <h2 class="font-display text-3xl sm:text-4xl text-ink tracking-tight mb-12">
      Read at the start, written while the picture is fresh.
    </h2>

    <div
      class="rounded-lg border border-border bg-panel-2/70 p-6 sm:p-8 font-mono text-xs sm:text-sm leading-relaxed text-ink-dim overflow-x-auto mb-12"
    >
      <pre class="text-ink-dim"><code>{`
  session start, or after a compaction
          │
          ▼
  SessionStart hook   checks portrait checksum
          │           shows the identity section
          ▼
  agent reads portrait.md whole
          │
          ├── topic hits a trigger word ──►  read that landscape whole (once)
          │
          ▼
  work  ──►  agent updates the landscape as threads change
          │
          ▼
  compaction or session end  ──►  synthesis job (next section)
`}</code></pre>
    </div>

    <ol class="relative border-l border-border ml-3 space-y-10">
      {
        steps.map((s, i) => (
          <li class="ml-7 relative">
            <span class="absolute -left-[34px] top-1 flex h-5 w-5 items-center justify-center rounded-full bg-bg border-2 border-accent/70 font-mono text-[10px] text-accent">
              {i + 1}
            </span>
            <h3 class="font-display text-xl text-ink">{s.title}</h3>
            <ul class="mt-2 space-y-1 text-ink-dim leading-relaxed">
              {s.body.map((line) => <li>{line}</li>)}
            </ul>
          </li>
        ))
      }
    </ol>
  </div>
</section>
